Land Surface Microwave Emissivity (LSME) from microwave imagers and geostationary IR data - processing source

This work is dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons Zero 1.0
Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication. To the extent possible under law,
the authors have waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to this
work:

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The GridSat-B1 infrared cloud product used as one of the two NOAA-controlled
inputs to this work is provided by Ken Knapp (Knapp WeatherSat Services LLC,
formerly NOAA NCEI).
The microwave + infrared land surface emissivity inversion approach follows the
published work of Prigent, Rossow, Aires, and colleagues, with the TELSEM2
climatology of Aires et al. (2011) as the validation reference.

